{
  "schema": "ld-s10y-image/figure-spec@2",
  "id": "fig-30",
  "mode": "deterministic",
  "description": "N15 prose illustration: the five source-visible arithmetic-sequence points share one 12-column, 18-row coordinate lattice with two units per cell and a dashed linear guide. This is an unapproved author draft. Source grid counts, scale and clear point positions come from the preserved one-view PHASE1 inventory; the intrinsic, pixel-verified upper ROI distinguishes grid/guide strokes from filled markers. No sixth or seventh data point is inferred from the formula. Regular dash spacing, square-grid cleanup, exact guide clipping to the lattice, ordinary origin O and clean mathematical typography are explicit modern construction choices, not additional source pixel facts.",
  "source": {
    "image": {
      "path": "/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-0789/lemmadeck/.tmp/resume182-6-8a-n15-0789/source/8a/pages/0093/figures/fig-30.png",
      "sha256": "984d895d101e4d13dfbe365c7d2c305dd4e8d686a3f308ca439e5ab3c0dbe6bd"
    },
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c3-s2-n15",
        "text": "我们来看由条件$a_1=6$，$d=4$给出的等差数列$(a_n)$.\n求出这个等差数列的通项：\n$a_n=6+4(n-1)$，\n也就是$a_n=4n+2$."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c3-s2-n15",
        "text": "我们得到的公式中，右边是二项式$4n+2$，变量$n(n\\in N)$是一次的.\n这就是说，等差数列$(a_n)$是在自然数集合$N$上由公式$y=4x+2$给出的线性函数."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c3-s2-n15",
        "text": "这个等差数列的图象是属于直线$y=4x+2$，横坐标是自然数的点的集合.\n例如，点$(1,6)$，$(2,10)$，$(3,14)$等等就是这个集合中的点（图30）."
      },
      {"lesson": "alg8-c3-s2-n15", "text": "图30"},
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c3-s2-n15",
        "text": "一般地，等差数列是在自然数集合上给出的线性函数."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c3-s2-n15",
        "text": "为了证明这一点，我们把等差数列的通项公式$a_n=a_1+d(n-1)$写成下列形式：\n$a_n=dn+(a_1-d)$."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c3-s2-n15",
        "text": "我们得到$y=kx+b$这种形式的公式，其中$k=d$和$b=a_1-d$是某一个数，$x=n$和$y=a_n$是变量.\n大家知道，这个公式给出的是线性函数."
      }
    ],
    "inventory": [
      {
        "id": "fig30-grid",
        "description": "Exact source lattice: 12 columns and 18 rows; origin four cells from the left, eight from the right, fifteen below the top and three above the bottom. Each horizontal and vertical cell represents two units. Bounds therefore read n=-8..16 and a_n=-6..30. Square-grid regularization removes scan skew without changing cells or scale.",
        "objects": ["fig30-grid", "fig30-frame"],
        "assertions": ["fig30-grid-dimensions", "fig30-origin-left-bottom", "fig30-origin-right-top"],
        "requires": ["gridDimensions"]
      },
      {
        "id": "fig30-axes-and-values",
        "description": "One shared n/a_n frame, rightward/upward axis arrows, source horizontal values 4 and 8, and source vertical values 4,8,12,16,20,24. No separate non-grid tick scale is asserted. Ordinary O and typeset subscript a_n are explicit modern typography, not proof of the uncertain source O/0 glyph.",
        "objects": [
          "fig30-axis-n", "fig30-axis-an", "fig30-arrow-n", "fig30-arrow-an",
          "fig30-label-n", "fig30-label-an", "fig30-origin-label",
